OL,3,GNEWSAFootbridge to close for
OL,4,Amaintenance work
OL,5,
OL,6,FA footbridge across the River Hull will
OL,7,Fbe closed for two weeks for maintenance
OL,8,Fwork, the council has said.
OL,10,FIn 2024, an inspection revealed Scale
OL,11,FLane bridge's bespoke swing mechanism
OL,12,Fwas in need of repair. It was closed
OL,13,Fearlier this year for further
OL,14,Finspections.
OL,16,FThe works, which are taking place from
OL,17,F3 November until 18 November, will
OL,18,Finclude the replacement of key
OL,19,Fconnection bolts within its swing
OL,20,Fmechanism.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
