OL,3,GNEWSAFootbridge to close for
OL,4,Amaintenance work
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe footbridge will be closed to
OL,7,Fpedestrians and cyclists, reopening in
OL,8,Ftime for the Christmas light switch-on
OL,9,Fin the city centre, Hull City Council
OL,10,Fsaid.
